b is big, this means that Bob must be big. But this doesn't directly tell us if Bob is round or not.\n\nBased on the analysis of the given statements, we can conclude that the statement \"Bob is round\" is true. Therefore, the correct answer is:\n\nA) True\n</think>\n<answer>\nA) True\n</answer>",
